<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Unify Normals</span></h1>
<hr align="left" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from</span> <i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Mesh &gt; Normals &gt; Unify</b></span></i><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="description"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span class="Command">Unify Normals</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command unifies all the polygon normals in the visible selected mesh. This command is grayed if there is no selection or all selections are hidden. It works on wholly selected entities as well as on partial selections.</span></p>
<p class="Example"><img src="../Mesh/images/Unify_Normals.gif" width="588px" height="307px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Neighbour distance</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Specifies the maximum distance between points from different sub-meshes that will be assumed as single surface and unified together. Default value is 0.01mm.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a2" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP1046227434" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<table cellspacing="5" class="whs5">
<col>
